Repository map — read the pointer, not the whole tree.

| Need | Path |
|---|---|
| Identity, voice, boot | `soul/` |
| Operating law, gates, audit standard | `law/` |
| Where things stand now | `state/CURRENT_STATE.md`, `state/HANDOFF.md` |
| Decisions already made (not findings) | `state/DECISIONS.md` |
| React / TypeScript conventions | `lanes/react/` |
| Kotlin / Jetpack Compose conventions | `lanes/kotlin-compose/` |
| Everything else | `lanes/general/` |
| Templates, local verification | `harness/` |
| Why the harness is built this way | `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` |

Work moves through five gates: **SCOPE → DESIGN → BUILD → AUDIT → DAVID**.
Start a unit of work with `/phase-card`. Finish a session with `/handoff`.

Protected — no edits without David's explicit GO on that file:
`soul/**`, `law/**`, `**/*.keystore`, `**/*.jks`, `.env*`, `**/*.pem`, `**/*.key`
